              "text": "प्रवर्षति (pravarṣati) is built from pra, \"forth\", and the root √vṛṣ, \"to rain\", which also gives varṣati, \"rains\"; MW gives pra-vṛṣ as to begin to rain, to rain, with the participle pravṛṣṭa (MW)."
